    "title": "Meet Together Link: A Free CLI That Runs Open Models Like Kimi K3 and GLM 5.3 Inside Claude Code, Codex, and OpenCode",
    "description": "<p>Together AI has released Together Link, a free, MIT-licensed CLI that connects Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode, Pi, and the Claude and ChatGPT desktop apps to open models like Kimi K3 and GLM 5.3. One install command sets it up, and an Auto router picks a model for each session. Together claims savings of over 50%.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/10/05/meet-together-link-a-free-cli-that-runs-open-models-like-kimi-k3-and-glm-5-3-inside-claude-code-codex-and-opencode/\">M...",
